よって私は、\n憎き源氏の業を受けてしまった。\n九郎判官、源義経。\n奥州に破滅を呼び込んだ、あの男の業を――","welcome":"かつて四代に渡り栄華を極めた、奥州藤原氏。\nその政の中心となったのが私、平泉館でございます。\n我が舞草刀の白刃を以って、\nお館様が築く黄金時代を切り拓いてみせましょう。","raw":{"CardID":3102,"ClassID":100,"Rarity":7,"VoiceID":1067,"AreaType":2,"GainableYakumodama":200,"DotScale":1.0,"HealthCorrection":118,"AttackCorrection":121,"DefenseCorrection":121,"RegenerationCorrection":100,"GrowUpID":1,"GrowUpLimitType":999,"AbilityID":93102,"GimmickID":3102,"CutInYCorrection":-200,"MaxRenovationCount":1,"RenovationType":4,"Renovation1AbilityID":94102,"Renovation1GimmickID":4102,"AutoProtect":1}}